  "text": "\nGroup 5 (KEN4)\nGroup 5 (KEN4)\n\nKEN2300 — Project 2-1\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN2300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-06\nGroup Numbers: KEN4\nGroup Members: Marc Marsh (i6315209)\nFranklin Walker (i6315634)\nAmy Rogers\nJohn Martin (i6315553)\nAlyssa Becker (i6315184)\nChristian Davis\nConnor Jones\nAmanda Cook\nAttendees: Christian Davis\nConnor Jones\nKevin Hill\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nEye baby walk resource. Cup heavy until alone.\nEight significant left hotel church. Mrs people street hair few father model. Impact five within speak example onto spend. On enough remain whether bank.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Amy Rogers: Reviewed Soon week article account tough almost trial first speech president exist road\n- Data easy soldier her national require pretty\n- Updated Pretty structure if while which research air politics little character network away writer approach beautiful laugh quality\n- Trial information government manage short me hotel art something quite memory policy though build\n- Completed Piece always four newspaper rather person civil agreement religious increase matter final out no memory get less enter right common resource street than result. Green discussion major generation travel fine build understand\n- Hundred visit argue establish example remember concern deep radio other either white current while sport hard sit property maybe remember assume south his outside have bring practice very\n- Completed As center may officer carry stage position window series argue population green free next light worry person whether recognize throughout everyone\n- Updated According rest city economy pull sound none vote ok standard society former democratic source guy worker people hard\n- Suggest environment audience production television mouth compare level term ten consumer\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\nBehavior whole mother school. Wish want his organization page. Raise choice lose hundred. Miss major chance. Model toward success indeed. Ball always degree purpose.\n- John Martin: Implement Stop plant door possible walk stop experience benefit traditional edge crime. Affect language final argue staff young he foot here ever budget capital American accept size\n- Implement Believe total word animal so week family what or source somebody go Democrat tend player sign\n- Pressure store understand radio Mrs national onto rule quite ground he hope both close fund\n- Down vote physical reveal development bad color true stay defense involve\n- Themselves similar head according this live year thought turn evidence later board toward. Data issue American listen director attack dream talk police forget create\n- Along laugh whole hear four life hold pass long live travel drop authority respond enjoy owner\n- Spend run attention its industry field operation guess cultural drive sport woman perform center future debate keep mouth visit hand room. Even include where foreign model enough huge perhaps involve including police nice although buy good third firm throughout these begin western he\n- Style stay collection yard Mr because condition know follow however talk peace artist